{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790970232,"nonce":"exAEY37VCXpxQ8JHwyRgM/5XOWE=","title":"Bodyless extern @:op members are skipped and their @:native siblings never linked","message":"Row: Issue10073 (the failing half is under `#if eval`, which rayzor defines).\n\ntast_to_hir.rs `seed_class_operator_methods`, `find_binary_operator_method` and\n`find_array_access_method` skip abstract methods with an empty body, so `extern @:op(A+B) add`\nand `@:op([]) get` are ignored and `bar+1` is a plain Int add; `bar[1]` indexes the Int as an\narray pointer (SIGSEGV).","files":null}]}